title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf uuid
catalog: CLI command
target: mf uuid
summary: Print the UUID of the metarecord standing for each path (the inverse of `mf path`); exit 1 if one has none

!! Reference

```
Print the UUID of the metarecord standing for each path (the inverse of `mf path`); exit 1 if one has none

Usage: mf uuid <PATHS>...

Arguments:
  <PATHS>...
          Filesystem paths (an existing path is canonicalised and made repo-root-relative; a leading-slash path gone from disk is taken as repo-root-relative — an orphan's stale path)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
